### Update User Profile Picture
PUT {{host}}/{{userId}}
{{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profilePicture": "https://res.cloudinary.com/your-cloud-name/image/upload/v1/profiles/new-photo.png"
}

### Delete User (requires ViewTeamMembers permission)
DELETE {{host}}/{{userId}}
{{authHeader}}

